  "title": "NUTEX HEALTH OPENS ARCHVIEW ER & HOSPITAL IN ST. LOUIS",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, Dec. 22, 2025 /PRNewswire/ — Nutex Health Inc. (“Nutex Health” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: NUTX), a physician-led, integrated healthcare delivery system comprised of 26 state-of-the-art micro hospitals and hospital outpatient departments in 12 states and primary care-centric, risk-bearing physician networks, today announced the opening of its 26th hospital in a new state: Missouri. Archview […]",
